---
onetaskgraph_template: 1
description: >-
  One grooming shard's verifying plan: the follow-up agent judging the tickets of one shard
  `onefollowup groom prepare` wrote. The grooming plan's `verify` step creates one per shard.
variables:
  project:
    description: The plan's native id, which its one member's id is prefixed with.
    type: string
    required: true
  batch:
    description: The grooming batch the shard belongs to.
    type: string
    required: true
  shard:
    description: The shard whose tickets are verified.
    type: string
    required: true
  checkout:
    description: The absolute path of the checkout every onefollowup command is run from.
    type: string
    required: true
  task:
    description: The absolute path of the task `onefollowup groom prepare` wrote for the shard.
    type: string
    required: true
  task_loader:
    description: The loader document `onepipeline template resolve follow-up-task --json` stated.
    type: string
    required: true
members:
  - id: "{{ project }}-verify"
    title: "Verify grooming shard {{ shard }}'s follow-up tickets"
    template: {loader: "{{ task_loader }}"}
    answers:
      mode: groom
      batch: "{{ batch }}"
      checkout: "{{ checkout }}"
      task_file: "{{ task }}"
    metadata:
      onepipeline.id: verify
      onepipeline.persona: ../personas/follow-up.yaml
      onepipeline.agent_graph: graphs/follow-up.yaml
---
Verify the tickets of grooming shard `{{ shard }}` of batch `{{ batch }}`.
